        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5055AC, Southwest Arts and Crafts Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arts and Crafts Lever is featured with an oil rubbed bronze finish to bring out the detailing on both the rose and the matching lever; but it is also available in satin nickel, matte black, and unlacquered brass finishes. This southwest style leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It is made to fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. The Southwest Arts and Crafts Lever is a rustic lever that is great for restorations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Arts and Crafts Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Arts & Crafts Lever with Matching Arts & Crafts Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5055AC-finish.jpg?v=1704354730\" width=\"456\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arts and Crafts Lever",
                "description": "The Arts and Crafts Lever is featured with an oil rubbed bronze finish to bring out the detailing on both the rose and the matching lever; but it is also available in satin nickel, matte black, and unlacquered brass finishes. This southwest style leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It is made to fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. The Southwest Arts and Crafts Lever is a rustic lever that is great for restorations.\r\n\r\n",
                "keywords": "EMT-5055AC, Arts & Crafts Lever with Arts & Crafts Roses, Arts and Crafts Levers, Emtek 5055AC, Emtek 5105AC, Emtek 5205AC, southwestern door levers, southwest door levers, craftsman levers,"
